[{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哟，来得真晚呢！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你居然比我要先到？天要塌了吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不对，我一定是在做梦。来让我揍一顿试试。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你就不能掐自己的脸皮吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「万一是现实的话我会痛的啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我也会痛啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，你为什么现在就来了呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那还用说，当然是来洗刷之前的污名。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「咦？哪个污名来着？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别说的好像我有很多个好不好！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「当然是输给女人的污名了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，那个啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「今天我就证明给你看，她绝对是男人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以才那么早来学校吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么，你到底打算怎么证明呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「若无其事地问出能确认是男性的问题。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「比如说？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「比如说，下次能不能借我剃须刀之类的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是能若无其事地问出口的问题吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么，你打算怎么把这问题自然而然地插入对话中呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「到时候再说，总会有办法的啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「看我发挥就是。」"},{"op":"choice","id":"2417:5005260","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"去看热闹","value":0,"serial":5005260},{"text":"留在教室","value":1,"serial":5005270}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":47,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原意气风发地走出了教室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「那…那个…冈崎君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"把包丢在座位上后，我跟着春原走了出去。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（嗯…？刚才好像有人叫我…？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（算了，不管了。）"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"goto","to":67},{"op":"ifFalse","to":67,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原意气风发地走出了教室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你不一起来吗！」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",805],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又跑回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我有说过要跟你去吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嘁…好吧，我一个人去就是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「一会儿我会问你结果的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，别忘了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再次跑了出去。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",205],"value":1},{"op":"return"},{"op":"background","image":"bg017"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",310],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「可能你们不觉得，但其实我是很忙的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那啥…今天我不是来找你打架的啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我们边走边说吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代将视线瞥向了我。像是在问，这男的在搞什么鬼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我耸了耸肩，示意自己不知道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没必要去其他地方吧。有话直说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？就在这？那好吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么说呢…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「快说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「其实呢，今天早上我一不小心就睡过头了呢。唉嘿。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你是不是换了个人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「然后呢，就在我想要刮胡子的时候，刀口忽然就崩了，可真是痛死我了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「所以不好意思，能不能借我一下你的剃须刀呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「为什么我非得借你不可呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「太好了！中计了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你也听到了吧，冈崎！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊，听是听到了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么，这又怎么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「刚才，你说不借我的吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「说了，那又怎么样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那也就是说，你是有剃须刀的。那么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我怎么可能会有那玩意儿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咦？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我的意思是，我有什么理由非要借你东西不可呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「再说了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「再说了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「问女性这种问题很没礼貌吧！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":130,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","g",23],1],["==",["v","g",45],1]]},{"op":"callScene","scene":1,"entry":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",225],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要死人了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你有点不对劲唉…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？哪？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「像泄气了的球一样扁了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我才没泄气呢，我一直都很强硬的！」"},{"op":"goto","to":155},{"op":"ifFalse","to":155,"condition":["||",["==",["v","g",23],0],["==",["v","g",45],0]]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":15},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":""},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":24},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这是正当防卫。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你骗谁啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，确实是正当防卫。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你到底是帮哪边的！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「别老是来惹我。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「害得我又下手了…」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完后，智代转身回到了教室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「失败了呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶…」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"return"},{"op":"background","image":"bg017"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",310],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你真的很烦人唉…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不不不，这次我真的没什么企图。只是来看看你而已。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「难以置信…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「没想到智代妹妹你还真是个美人啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这种口是心非的话还是省省吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哪有，可以说是大饱眼福！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哎呀，都已经这个时候了吗。下一节课快开始了呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是啊，所以你还是快点回去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「糟了，下一节课要用的胸部忘记带了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「智代，能不能把你的胸部借我一下啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「为什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「太好了！中计了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「既然你会问为什么，那就说明你的胸部是可以出借的！是可以拆下来的没错吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么可能拆得下来…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「再说了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「再说了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「哪有需要用得到胸部的课啊ー！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":220,"condition":["&&",["&&",["==",["v","g",23],1],["==",["v","g",45],1]],["==",["v","f",225],1]]},{"op":"callScene","scene":1,"entry":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",225],"value":2},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要死人了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你是春原吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「当然了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别问这种奇怪的问题啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，总觉得看上去像是别人…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你在说什么呢。还没睡醒吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嘁，回教室吧。」"},{"op":"goto","to":262},{"op":"ifFalse","to":262,"condition":["||",["||",["==",["v","g",23],0],["==",["v","g",45],0]],["==",["v","f",225],0]]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":15},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":""},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":24},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是正当防卫。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ｂ"]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":249,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],"朋也"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":250},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":253,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你，你们这对冷血组合ーー！」"},{"op":"goto","to":262},{"op":"ifFalse","to":262,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「…怎么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呃…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呜哇啊啊啊啊啊ーーーーーーーーー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你连找回场子的词都想不出来了吗…。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶，没那么容易露出马脚啊…」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":290,"condition":[">",["v","f",225],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说，你啊…还是去医院看看吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？为什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，你看看你自己的脸再来问我吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别急，下节课间休息的时候，你等着看就好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊…某种意义上，还真是看到了很恐怖的东西呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看在认识的份上我还是劝你一句，趁你还勉强有个人样的时候快点住手吧，要不就晚了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么能在这里打退堂鼓呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你的一举一动都成恐怖片了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，你真的是春原吧…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈啊？还用问吗，当然是你熟悉的春原了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗，那就好…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「很好，你还是那个一如既往的春原！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「噢！」"},{"op":"goto","to":302},{"op":"ifFalse","to":302,"condition":["==",["v","f",225],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还用问吗，当然是因为是女的了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别急，下节课间休息的时候，你等着看就好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那还真是令人期待。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"反正，结果肯定是你又飞舞在空中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「Have a good H！（祝你有个好变态！）」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「噢！」"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"background","image":"bg017"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",310],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「都说叫你适可而止了吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不，这次可和之前不一样。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「每次都这么说，结果不还是一样吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这次是真的不一样…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这次啊ーー！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":320,"condition":["==",["v","f",225],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…呜哇，有够吓人的。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"goto","to":323},{"op":"ifFalse","to":323,"condition":["<",["v","f",225],2]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原突然向智代扑了过去。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代的飞踢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「Ouchh!」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（为什么会是英语…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被踢得狠狠地撞在墙上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没事吧…不小心使出全力踢上去了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「应该很痛吧。所以，别来缠着我了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呸。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝地上吐了一口含有鲜血的唾沫后，慢慢地爬了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哼，稍微陪我一下吧，智代。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「去干什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怕啥啊，就在那边，没多少路的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好了，跟我来吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原迈开了步伐。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「真是拿你没办法呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代跟在后面。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稍微走了一段路，转弯。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"出现在眼前的是，男厕所。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":357,"condition":["&&",["&&",["==",["v","g",23],1],["==",["v","g",45],1]],["==",["v","f",225],2]]},{"op":"callScene","scene":1,"entry":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",225],"value":3},{"op":"goto","to":363},{"op":"ifFalse","to":363,"condition":["||",["||",["==",["v","g",23],0],["==",["v","g",45],0]],["!=",["v","f",225],2]]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":13},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原再次高高飞起，落到远处。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你们两个到底想干什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一路拖着和破抹布般动弹不得的春原，回到了我的面前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「简直无法想象，居然想把我带到男厕所里去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「恶作剧也要有个限度啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「他只是想要确认一下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「确认什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你到底是不是女的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我还是第一次被这样侮辱呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「和我没关系哦。是这家伙想要确认的。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":390,"condition":["==",["v","f",225],3]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你不也想要搞明白的吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呜哇…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，我可没那打算。而且怎么想她都是女的吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那你对我说Good H！干什么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你现在眼睛和嘴巴挤到了很神奇的位置哦…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咦，H！？不是Luck吗！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，你还是去照照镜子吧，会更吃惊的…」"},{"op":"goto","to":399},{"op":"ifFalse","to":399,"condition":["<",["v","f",225],3]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你不也想要搞明白的吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可没那打算。而且怎么想她都是女的吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那你对我说Good H！干什么…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咦，H！？不是Luck吗！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错。我从一开始就期待着你的变态行为。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你算计我！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「抱歉啦。不过，你也应该够解气了吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我试着安抚智代的情绪。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我咽不下这口气…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「既然如此，就给我仔细确认好了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「过来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代拉起了我的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「干什么啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那个男人我接受不来，不过你的话还勉强能忍一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是被怒火冲昏了头脑，拉着我大步流星地向前。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg019"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一路来到了没有人烟的地方后，智代终于松开了我的手腕。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，冷静点。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这要人怎么能冷静下来…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你知道我刚才有多震惊吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我还以为自己在这所学校里，已经完完全全是一个普通女孩了呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你的感性也够奇怪的了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你的过去实在是太离谱了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「或许和那样的过去比起来，现在的确是收敛了不少。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「原来你知道啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「传闻而已。那全部都是真的吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「虽然不知道是什么样的传闻，但应该八九不离十吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「一直过着不太平的日子…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，我已经不是以前的我了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我觉得自己已经改变了才对…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是…却因为我们两个发现了实际并非如此。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（那确实是，刺激到她了吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还记得之前操场上的闹剧吗。少干那种事吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那不是我能控制的事情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那些家伙是来找我的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你才转学就又干什么了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没有。我什么都没干。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「只是去提醒了他们一下。让他们不要聚在路中间。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「很普通吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可不觉得普通女生会去做这种事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「但他们妨碍到其他人了啊？路边老爷爷老奶奶一脸困扰的样子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，知道了知道了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm34"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「然后，他们看到了我的校服，于是一路追到学校来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「放着不管的话，他们会一直在操场上等我出来。那样又会给别的学生添麻烦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以，只能我出面了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么样。不是我能控制的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「普通女生应该会交给老师来解决吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那多不好意思。虽说是为了帮助他人，但毕竟起因在我这里。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呵…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对这种人，我应该说什么才好呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「以后有得受的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"除此之外想不出任何可能。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你眼里的那些普通行为，基本上都和普通女生的常识大不一样。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我也算是尽自己努力尝试过了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以还是希望，你能说的委婉一些。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「虽然可能看不出来，但我是很容易受伤的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那还真是失礼了。我说话一直很刻薄的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，你想要努力当普通女生，是有什么目的吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「问得好！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"态度忽然一变，眼睛也开始放光。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那个笨蛋说我是为了要受男生欢迎才这样做的，但事实完全不是这样。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我有我自己的目的在。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「虽然现在还不能告诉你最终的目标…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「但可以告诉你，我当前的目标。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别装样子了。到底是什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯。就是我要进入学生会。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「洗漱柜？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「谁会想进那种东西里啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「而且也太小了吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，也是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不是洗漱柜。有点像但不对。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「水桶？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那也太小了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「垃圾桶。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，那倒是进得去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一脸满足的样子。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不对…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你的反应，很慢啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「别开玩笑了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是学生会啦，学生会。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你说真的…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「为什么要用这种表情看我。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么表情？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不想和这家伙有瓜葛的表情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这样又如何。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「尽力在隐瞒不想和这家伙有瓜葛的表情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看来我这人还是太诚实了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代好像很沮丧，一副失望的模样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？怎么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm34"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不知道为什么…感觉很容易和你说话。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「和我没还没太多交流吧。基本都是春原在找你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，是这样没错…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那换个说法，是氛围吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「感觉和班里的同学，和聚集在我身边的那些家伙不同，你有很容易让人开口的氛围。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那还真是，多谢夸奖。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以被你说不想再有瓜葛，是多少有些失望的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，你的失望可是正确的哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「别说我听不懂的话。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你看，我在这所学校里可不是什么好学生。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「因这样的坏学生嘴里吐出的话而感到失望的话，那不就说明你是正确的那一方？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「原来如此…原来你是坏学生吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「都三年级了还在这里游手好闲的，那当然算不上是正常学生了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我就觉得哪里不对劲…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没想到这所学校里除我之外，居然还有像你这样的人在呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那种让人安心的感觉，也是因为这个吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽然我不像你之前那么严重，不过，确实有相似的地方在。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，事实上…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「如果你真的以学生会为目标的话，还是不要和我扯上关系比较好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是被老师盯上了的话你就麻烦了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「学生会和老师没关系才对吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话是这么说啦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是朋友里有人进了学生会，我可会头皮发麻的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「现在还不是呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也对。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我迈出了步子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，也没有必要强求缘分吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你要去哪？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么去哪，当然是回去了。不快点的话，上课铃就要响了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「但还没有让你确认啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「确认？喂…你意思是…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那还用说。来确认我是不是女的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「来摸几下吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你认真的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「当然了。我也憋着一口气。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没有比刚才那事更让人觉得耻辱的了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，我知道你是女的啦。不管怎么看都是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不一定哦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不是女的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不，是女的没错…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，连半点调查都没就承认了的话，也不是滋味啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「至少我无法接受。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我会和春原说我摸过了的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我不喜欢像这样，简简单单就说谎的行为。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你想要我摸吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么可能。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真复杂呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「复杂…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「对了，都说最复杂的莫过于女人心了。我这样是不是很像普通女孩？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我选择了无视继续前进。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「喂，冈崎。我在问你话呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「女人心是不是很复杂啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，确实。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那么，现在的我很像普通女孩，没错吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，没错。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你是不是在耍我。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我停下了脚步，捏了捏智代的脸蛋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你干什么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又软又暖。是真的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「还用说吗…」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg017"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么样，冈崎。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":619,"condition":[">",["v","f",225],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别管这个了，你还是先去医院吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「顺便一说，手感又软又暖。是真的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的假的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶ーーー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我到底是因为确定她是女的而不甘心，还是自己作为男人不甘心。自己都弄不懂了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你现在有更重要的事要解决吧…」"},{"op":"goto","to":625},{"op":"ifFalse","to":625,"condition":["==",["v","f",225],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「手感又软又暖。是真的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的假的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶ーーー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我到底是因为确定她是女的而不甘心，还是自己作为男人不甘心。自己都弄不懂了…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",208],"value":1},{"op":"return"},{"op":"return"}]